      finishOps B (AspisR1.NP6_StdModel.calls reservation);
  ∃ f s outer pre middle fs ss run tx2,
    AspisR1.Cons_Native.Calls (AspisR1.AuS1_Install.base stageBase) finishOps reserved queryOps geoOps
