                    (AspisR1.S2W_EntryWriteHistory.payloadBytes AspisR1.S2W_ReturnedCheckpoint.encode
                      (post1.payload (e1.heap.accounts 2).1) 1768) ∧
                  AspisR1.TxS_CallerSource.Outcome L e1 e2 w1 w2 adapterOps ops reserved queryOps geoOps stageBase
                    finishOps B (AspisR1.NP6_StdModel.calls reservation) program data1 data2 slot saved post1 post2 H f
                    s outer pre middle fs ss run prior tx2
